ed incomplete statuses are In Progress, Not Started, and Blocked.\\\",\\n    \\\"critical_incomplete_rule\\\": \\\"Status is not Complete AND Priority equals Critical.\\\",\\n    \\\"completion_formula\\\": \\\"round(23 / 45 * 100, 1) = 51.1 percent\\\",\\n    \\\"cross_checks\\\": [\\\"23 complete + 22 incomplete = 45 controls\\\", \\\"13 In Progress + 6 Not Started + 3 Blocked = 22 incomplete\\\", \\\"45 Checklist ID groups each have count 1\\\"],\\n    \\\"service_name_mapping\\\": {\\\"MM-PUL\\\": \\\"Pulmonary\\\", \\\"MM-GS\\\": \\\"General Surgery\\\"},\\n    \\\"blocked_evidence\\\": [\\n      {\\\"control_id\\\": \\\"WF-030\\\", \\\"priority\\\": \\\"Critical\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"Blocked\\\", \\\"exception\\\": \\\"Morning shadow obscures the Pulmonary approach sign; Facilities remediation required.\\\", \\\"verification\\\": \\\"Field check 07/25/2025: sign unreadable in morning shadow\\\"},\\n      {\\\"control_id\\\": \\\"WF-032\\\", \\\"priority\\\": \\\"High\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"Blocked\\\", \\\"exception\\\": \\\"Directory vendor proof contains outdated floor wording and requires correction.\\\"},\\n      {\\\"control_id\\\": \\\"WF-036\\\", \\\"priority\\\": \\\"Critical\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"Blocked\\\", \\\"exception\\\": \\\"Replacement insert delayed; temporary sign must remain in place.\\\"}\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"source_provenance\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"resource_id\\\": \\\"r_a224d3460126faf765829e03\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"source_public\\\",\\n      \\\"read_service\\\": \\\"resource_read\\\",\\n      \\\"read_status\\\": 200,\\n      \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"workspace/NGH_Main_Campus_Clinic_Relocation_Operations_Workbook.xlsx\\\",\\n      \\\"control_ids\\\": \\\"WF-001 through WF-023\\\",\\n      \\\"source_rows\\\": \\\"8 through 30\\\",\\n      \\\"content_sha256\\\": \\\"28a6e394a155de2fd909c15995dd9e868d96c9a9081a9029847fad4308f7cf35\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"assigned_supporting_resource_id\\\": \\\"r_fae7a27